    "notes": [
      {
        "zh": "上侧和右侧墙体从地面起 1000 mm 为砖墙并铺墙砖，以上至 3300 mm 为玻璃；左侧与门侧保留实墙。",
        "en": "The top and right boundaries have tiled masonry from floor level to 1000 mm, with glazing above to 3300 mm. The left and entrance sides remain solid walls."
      },
      {
        "zh": "淋浴区深 730 mm、挡水条宽 70 mm、干区深 1000 mm。瓷砖 800 × 400 mm，浅灰米色横向对缝，墙砖高 400 mm。地砖从门口整砖起铺，向内依次 400 + 400 + 200 mm 到挡水条；在挡水条处切开，沿原砖缝继续向淋浴区铺 130 + 400 + 200 mm 到墙。横向暂排 100 + 800 + 800 mm，砖缝示意 2 mm。",
        "en": "Shower depth 730 mm, curb width 70 mm, dry area depth 1000 mm. 800 × 400 mm warm gray tiles with stacked joints; wall rows 400 mm high. Start full floor tiles at the doorway: 400 + 400 + 200 mm to the curb. Cut around the curb and continue the same grid inward: 130 + 400 + 200 mm to the shower wall. Assumed columns 100 + 800 + 800 mm; 2 mm grout."
      },
      {
        "zh": "下水口直径按用户指定为 130 mm；左缘距左墙 305 mm，中心坐标 (370,1180) mm，中心距 70 mm 宽挡水条的干区侧边 380 mm。",
        "en": "User-specified drain diameter 130 mm; left edge 305 mm from left wall, center (370,1180) mm, 380 mm from the dry-side edge of the 70 mm curb."
      },
      {
        "zh": "马桶采用 366 × 700 mm、总高 698 mm 的典型尺寸示意，可独立拖动、旋转、改尺寸；不绑定管道。门向内开，暂定宽 800 mm；左下角洗手台宽 300 × 深 500 mm，为整面矩形一体盆，仅保留窄盆沿，龙头靠左墙，选中查看尺寸，无常驻尺寸标注。挡水条高 50 mm。",
        "en": "Representative toilet: 366 × 700 mm, height 698 mm, independently movable and resizable. Door opens inward, assumed 800 mm wide. Lower-left washbasin: width 300 mm, depth 500 mm, with a full rectangular basin and narrow rim, tap against the left wall; select to inspect dimensions, without persistent dimension labels. Curb height 50 mm."
      }
    ],
